<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/47/eng@/~cl_3__subsec_1__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for section 3 as amended by subsection 2(1) the following seclion: \" Remu- 3. (1) The remuneration of Members neration of of Parliament shall consist of— Members of Par- (a) in the case of a member of the liament. Senate, a monthly allowance of two thousand eight hundred ringgit; (b) in the case of a member of the House of Representatives, a monthly allowance of four thousand eight ringgit. (2) Where a Member of Parliament is designated as Leader of the Opposition, he shall be entitled, in addition to the monthly allowance specified in paragraph (b) of subsection (1), to a monthly allowance of two thousand eight hundred ringgit.\";"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/47/eng@> .
