<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/47/eng@/~cl_4__list_2__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding section 7 of the principal Act, all monthly salaries and allowances specified amendments to the principal Act in subsection (1) and payable shall commence from the 1st January 1992 or from the date of appointment or election, whichever is the later, of the Members of Parliament, the President or Deputy President of the Senate, the Speaker or Deputy Speaker of the House of Representatives, the Members of the Administration, the Leader or Deputy Leader of the House of Representatives or the Leader of the Opposition, as the case may be."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/47/eng@> .
